[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Zephyr RTOS Safety Manual
REQ_PREFIX: SM-

[GRAMMAR]
IMPORT_FROM_FILE: safety_manual.sgra

[TEXT]
STATEMENT: >>>
This safety manual is based on IEC 61508-3 Annex D, with base requirements from
IEC 61508-2 Annex D.

A safety manual for compliant items provides all the information relating to the functional
safety of an element that is required to ensure that the system meets the requirements of the
IEC 61508 series (IEC 61508-4, 3.8.17).
<<<

